Conventions renumbering procedure
title end

paragraph start
Renumbering happens only when the order of the work changes or a new step is inserted, and only after the owner approves.
paragraph end

paragraph start
The steps are: decide the new position, move every later number in that folder up by one, rename the files and folders in one batch, update the subfolder list in the folder purpose file and the folder list in the root introduction, then check a sample of pages.
paragraph end

paragraph start
If any step fails, stop and report the real output. Do not repair by guessing.
paragraph end

paragraph start
todo: write a script that renumbers a folder and updates every reference
Today this is done in one batch by an AI after the owner approves.
paragraph end

